# Template for .env, which is gitignored. Copy this file, fill in what you need.
#
# Docker Compose automatically loads .env from the project directory for ${VAR}
# interpolation in docker-compose.yml. Nothing below is wired into compose yet --
# this file exists so there is one inventory of every credential the station
# uses, which the Phase 8 runbook can point at instead of hunting through
# three applications.

# --- MQTT -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mosquitto runs with allow_anonymous true, which the build plan accepts on a
# trusted LAN segment. Set these only if you add auth (mosquitto.conf gains a
# password_file directive and allow_anonymous false).
# MQTT_USERNAME=
# MQTT_PASSWORD=

# --- Phase 7: post-processing ------------------------------------------------
# The iNaturalist submission pipeline, fed from best.jpg?crop=1 plus the clean
# snapshot copy. Does not exist yet.
# INAT_TOKEN=
# MERLIN_TOKEN=

# --- BirdNET-Go optional services --------------------------------------------
# Set these through the BirdNET-Go web UI, not here -- they live in its own
# config.yaml, which is gitignored and scrubbed by
# scripts/export-birdnet-config.sh before anything reaches the repo. Listed here
# only so the inventory is complete.
# EBIRD_API_KEY=
# BIRDWEATHER_ID=
# OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=
# WUNDERGROUND_API_KEY=
